summary of the key points.                              \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mResearch:\u001b[0m I can provide facts, historical data, and general information on almost any subject.                                         \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;35m💻 Coding and Technical Help\u001b[0m                                                                                                              \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                           "]
[0.000, "o", "                                                                                                \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mWriting Code:\u001b[0m I can generate code in languages like Python, JavaScript, C++, HTML/CSS, and more.                                       \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mDebugging:\u001b[0m If your code isn't working, paste it here, and I can help find the error.                                                   \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mData:\u001b[0m I can help write SQL queries or explain mathematical formulas.                                                                   \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;35m🌍 Languages\u001b[0m                                                                                                                              \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mTranslation:\u001b[0m I can translate text between dozens of major world languages.                                                             \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mLanguage Learning:\u001b[0m I can help you practice a conversation or explain grammatical rules in another language.                            \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0